dth=600 height=238 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678710/extras/5dc4114410b63711c491290eb4fd7fe6.webm?t=1728717696\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678710/extras/5dc4114410b63711c491290eb4fd7fe6.mp4?t=1728717696\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>FREE YOUR FRIENDS</strong><br>When you are caught it isnt over yet! Work with your friends to save yourself from jail and continue to complete the mission.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><strong>PC and VR Crossplay</strong> <br>Play on PC or VR.<br><strong>Randomly Generated Workplaces</strong> <br>No two workplaces are the same, workplaces are randomly generated to ensure it always feels like your first day.<br>Play and complete games to unlock more characters, apps and customizations",
